        "fadetime": 0.6,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Nothing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "text": "They won't say a word.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "text": "Or perhaps... they just don't know anything.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like the other Reunion members we defeated, they're probably nothing more than obedient puppets.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Make them speak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Use any methods necessary.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want to know about their squads, their leadership, their strategies, where they're from, and what they plan to do...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Get everything out of them that you can.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "I want everything I can get.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Report back to me right away, no matter how insignificant it might seem.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1",
        "name2": "char_015_lmg",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Roger!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Has the L.G.D. ever arrested Reunion members before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We can't say for sure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the end, it's just speculation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Get me in touch with Hoshiguma!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "How's the Special Operations Division faring?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are they still being overwhelmed by a single Infected?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Reunion seems to have pulled back on their end as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "text": "Inspector Hoshiguma is worried about a possible trap and is trying to rule out all risks...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph... Just a single person...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Who the hell do they think they are, coming and going like that?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "You should already know what your next mission is going to be, Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We're going to get Misha back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Correct.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "This will be the joint operation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "The L.G.D. will take the lead, while Rhodes Island will be in charge of recon and the assault.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your mission is complete as long as you can stall Reunion's retreat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
